  "agent": {
    "note": "**TAKE 2 — corner-M on the gallery asset + a three-beat tutorial** (founder on take 1: \"seems fine to me. lets add the brand M on the template cover asset, and prepare a render tutorial. keep it simple on how to use. select images, or a folder of images\").\n\n- **Gallery asset stamped**: `poster.png` = `preview.png` (your 07-12 real-photo sheet, 1280×720) now carry the corner-M bottom-right (40px, the gate-29/30 stamp tool; TARGETS entry added). Pixels otherwise untouched.\n- **Tutorial (`renderTutorial`, the Make \"?\" pill + `m0saic make <id> --tutorial`)**: three beats, ~13s, the shared SaaS kit —\n  1. **Pick photos — or a whole folder** (a folder listing of mixed-size files; \"Images → files or a folder\"),\n  2. **The sheet lays itself out** (a REAL demo-set solve inlined at the slot's true pixels — hero / portrait / panorama cells, inset gutters),\n  3. **More photos? More sheets** (two page cards, each a real solve of half the set; \"Max per sheet · 30 by default\").\n  Deterministic, media-free, own step timing (4.2 / 4.4 / 4.2 s); portrait canvases stack copy above the visual. 3 new locks (97/97 collage tests).\n\nRecipe unchanged (pure defaults). The tutorial lives on the template, not in this recipe — open the \"?\" in Make to play it, or `m0saic make @m0saic/collage/image-collage/v1 --tutorial -o tut.mp4`.",
    "question": "Tutorial read right? Tone/beats OK or trim further? Then stress-01..10 remain open."
